# Milestone: M3 / v0.8.0
# Covers: ',' and '&' at chunk-top work with the v0.8.0 persistent loader
# strand (urbi_strand_create_for_module path).  Prior to v0.8.0 the REPL
# used a transient strand with no entry_closure and these opcodes produced
# a runtime TypeError; that guard has been superseded by the persistent
# strand path.  The unit tests in test_fork.c and test_loader_strand_persistence.c
# exercise fork semantics in more depth.

1 , 2
[00000000] 2

1 & 2
[00000001] <?>
